{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q3980906","formula":"TaC","hill":"CTa","elements":["C","Ta"],"composition":{"C":1.0,"Ta":1.0},"names":{"en":"Tantalcarbide","ru":"Самородный тантал","uk":"Тантал самородний"},"descriptions":{"en":"Tantalcarbide is a rare mineral of tantalum carbide with formula TaC. With a molecular weight of 192.96 g/mol, its primary constituents are tantalum (93.78%) and carbon (6.22%), and has an isometric crystal system. It generally exhibits a bronze or brown to yellow color. On the Mohs hardness scale it registers as a 6–7.","uk":"Танталкарбід (до 1966 - тантал самородний) — рідкісний мінерал класу самородних елементів, карбід танталу. Його молекулярна маса становить 192,96 г/моль, основними складовими його є тантал (93,78%) та вуглець (6,22%)."},"fame":8,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q12089225","names":{"en":"mineral species","ru":"действительный вид минералов","uk":"мінеральний вид"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"crystal","source":"materialsproject","ref":"mp-1086","atoms":27,"license":"CC BY 4.0, Materials Project"},"structure":{"cell":[[4.468,0.0,0.0],[0.0,4.468,0.0],[0.0,0.0,4.468]],"kind":"crystal","atoms":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0,"el":"Ta"},{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":4.468,"el":"Ta"},{"x":0.0,"y":4.468,"z":0.0,"el":"Ta"},{"x":0.0,"y":4.468,"z":4.468,"el":"Ta"},{"x":4.468,"y":0.0,"z":0.0,"el":"Ta"},{"x":4.468,"y":0.0,"z":4.468,"el":"Ta"},{"x":4.468,"y":4.468,"z":0.0,"el":"Ta"},{"x":4.468,"y":4.468,"z":4.468,"el":"Ta"},{"x":0.0,"y":2.234,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":0.0,"y":2.234,"z":4.468,"el":"C"},{"x":4.468,"y":2.234,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":4.468,"y":2.234,"z":4.468,"el":"C"},{"x":0.0,"y":2.234,"z":2.234,"el":"Ta"},{"x":4.468,"y":2.234,"z":2.234,"el":"Ta"},{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":2.234,"el":"C"},{"x":0.0,"y":4.468,"z":2.234,"el":"C"},{"x":4.468,"y":0.0,"z":2.234,"el":"C"},{"x":4.468,"y":4.468,"z":2.234,"el":"C"},{"x":2.234,"y":0.0,"z":2.234,"el":"Ta"},{"x":2.234,"y":4.468,"z":2.234